uality compounder at a fair price, not a bargain. The 3-product commercial base (INGREZZA, CRENESSITY, VYKAT) is real, cash-generative, and growing; the balance sheet is net cash; guidance has been upgraded. However: (1) base-case MoS is only 8%; (2) the VYKAT safety signal is unresolved and represents a genuine thesis-breaker; (3) the 2029 IRA event and 2031\u20132037 patent erosion are insufficiently discounted relative to the 22\u00d7 trailing multiple. The expected value (+9.1%) does not justify a full position today. The position should be sized as a starter, monitored quarterly against the Section 8 KPIs, and upgraded only upon: (a) VYKAT safety resolution consistent with background mortality; (b) INGREZZA 2027 guidance \u2265 +8% with no IRA selection; or (c) a positive Phase 3 readout in 2027. Conversely, any adverse VYKAT regulatory action or INGREZZA guidance cut triggers immediate re-evaluation and likely exit.\n\n\u2014 END OF REPORT \u2014"}, {"sample": 3, "iv": 113.0, "plausible": true, "reasons": [], "flags": [], "truncated": false, "secs": 362, "report": "```markdown\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\u25a0 RS2 v2.0 INTEGRATED INVESTMENT ANALYSIS \u2014 NEUROCRINE BIOSCIENCES (NBIX)\n\u25a0 Analysis date: 2026-08-24 | T0 price: $152.57 [Actual \u2014 vendor quote]\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2